# An ADR uses a German status (ADR-0045: ADR format is English)
command: cargo xtask docs
expect: status `akzeptiert` is invalid
--- patch
diff --git a/docs/adr/0045-repository-language-english.md b/docs/adr/0045-repository-language-english.md
--- a/docs/adr/0045-repository-language-english.md
+++ b/docs/adr/0045-repository-language-english.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
 id: ADR-0045
 title: The repository is English; German exists only as the UI language pack
-status: accepted
+status: akzeptiert
 date: 2026-10-14
 crates: [xtask, qoob3d-app]
 tags: [documentation, process, i18n]
